{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35866","headline":"和友人喜相遇十首 四 · 李咸用","name":"和友人喜相遇十首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不傍江烟访所思，更应无处展愁眉。\n数杯竹阁花残酒，一局松窗日午碁。\n多病却疑天与便，自愚潜喜衆相欺。\n非穷非达非高尚，冷笑行藏秪独知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35866.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35866","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}